{"root":{"data":{"id":"6ab85c2078ad","created":1578022174,"text":"Vue.js（施工中）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlyqufr3s00","created":1578035068218,"text":"基础","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlu801pih40","created":1578022307071,"text":"介绍","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlu836de4w0","created":1578022313883,"text":"概念"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlugahueu00","created":1578022956727,"text":"构建用户界面的渐进式progressive框架，Vue被设计为可以自底向上逐层应用。\nVue的核心库只关心View layer视图层，易于上手和整合\n和其它「modern tooling」、「supporting libraries」结合使用"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlugbwi09s0","created":1578022959790,"text":"安装","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlugezglnc0","created":1578022966500,"text":"直接引入：\n<!-- 开发环境版本，包含了有帮助的命令行警告 -->\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vue/dist/vue.js\"></script>\nor\n<!-- 生产环境版本，优化了尺寸和速度 -->\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vue\"></script>\n使用vue标签引入，文件是vue.js（实质上是js引入vue）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bzluhizl8cw0","created":1578023053579,"text":"vue-cli\n文件会是类似test.vue"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzluhxnss1c0","created":1578023085518,"text":"声明式渲染\nDeclarative Rendering","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzluib1sglk0","created":1578023114662,"text":"declaratively render data to the DOM\nVue link data to DOM"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bzlv7oiwdog0","created":1578025103099,"text":"directive指令：v-bind"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlxhr4nzg00","created":1578031534630,"text":"条件与循环\nconditionals & loops"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlxinrip9c0","created":1578031605669,"text":"bind data not only DOM text文本 or attributes特性\nbut also the structure of the DOM结构。\ntransition effect system可以在 Vue 插入/更新/移除元素时自动应用过渡效果"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlxmr8fgd40","created":1578031926678,"text":"处理用户输入"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlxmuuckfc0","created":1578031934534,"text":"event listener事件监听器v-on"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlxo9apx5s0","created":1578032044363,"text":"组件化应用构建\ncomposing with components","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bzlxoj4wf8g0","created":1578032065779,"text":"components: small, self-contained（独立）, reusable\n任意类型的应用页面都可以抽象为一个组件树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bzly3b26eww0","created":1578033223662,"text":"组件本质上是一个Vue实例，有预定义选项\na Vue instance with pre-defined options"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bzly57i39k00","created":1578033372646,"text":"Vue组件类似自定义元素（Custom Elements）\n因为Vue的组件语法参考了Web Components Spec(Web组件规范)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bzlymu17hcw0","created":1578034753882,"text":"Vue和Web Components Spec区别\nWeb Components规范完成并通过，但只有部分浏览器原生支持Web Components\nVue组件不需要任何polyfill即可在浏览器上保持一致\n\nVue组件既可以包装在Custom Elements里，也提供纯自定义元素不具备的一些功能\nVue Cli支持将Vue组件构建成为原生的自定义元素","note":"In web development, a polyfill (or polyfiller) is downloadable code which provides facilities that are not built into a web browser. It implements technology that a developer expects the browser to provide natively, providing a more uniform API landscape. For example, many features of HTML5 are not supported by versions of Internet Explorer older than version 8 or 9, but can be used by web pages if those pages install a polyfill. Web shims and HTML5 Shivs are related concepts."},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyqxm6pc00","created":1578035075137,"text":"Vue Instance实例","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bznw9f67s4g0","created":1578231180492,"text":"创建一个Vue实例"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c0q0ww4t35k0","created":1582103582581,"text":"每个Vue应用都是通过Vue函数创建一个新的Vue实例\nvar vm = new Vue({\n  // options\n})\nvue部分参考了MVVM模式，vm（ViewModel）常用于指Vue instance"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q0yzcmrls0","created":1582103746313,"text":"创建一个Vue实例的时候，可以传入选项对象(options object)，\n使用options来创建行为"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q106idd9s0","created":1582103840262,"text":"Vue应用通过new Vue创建的root vue instance以及组件components树组成\n所有的Vue 组件都是Vue实例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0punwpkq6g0","created":1582085951900,"text":"数据与方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c0q12zhjit40","created":1582104060066,"text":"当Vue实例被创建，它将data对象中所有属性(properties)加入Vue的响应式系统(reactivity system)\n当properties的值发生改变，view(视图)会响应，匹配更新为新的值"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q1dcz5w3k0","created":1582104873072,"text":"var data = {a:1}\nvar vm = new Vue({data: data})\n\n此时 vm.a == data.a，不管是设置vm实例还是data上的属性，都会互相影响\n数据改变时，视图会进行re-render"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q1eqoh70o0","created":1582104981265,"text":"只有实例创建时存在于data的属性才是响应式的，比如单独添加新的属性\nvm.b = 'hi'\n单独对b 的改动不会触发视图更新(trigger view updates)\n若需要进行响应式追踪的属性应在data里设置initial value（e.g. null, empty value）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q1hrfdwy00","created":1582105217984,"text":"如果使用Object.freeze()会阻止修改现有的属性，不再track changes"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q1ll6a5io0","created":1582105517830,"text":"除了data属性，vue本身有很多实例属性instance properties/methods，\n为了和自定义属性user-defined properties，属性前用$标识"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0puo4dpa740","created":1582085968596,"text":"实例生命周期钩子\nLifecycle hook"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c0q1oaldd0w0","created":1582105729890,"text":"每个vue实例在创建时的初始化过程initialization steps\ne.g. data observation数据监听, compile the template编译模版, \n挂载mount the instance to the DOM, update the DOM when data changes\n还有些functions 称为lifecycle hooks生命周期钩子，让用户可以添加自己的代码"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c0q1r9cnssw0","created":1582105962279,"text":"不要在选项属性或回调上使用箭头函数arrow functions，\n比如 created: () => console.log(this.a) 或 vm.$watch('a', newValue => this.myMethod())。\n因为箭头函数并没有 this，this 会作为变量一直向上级词法作用域查找，直至找到为止，\n经常导致 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read property of undefined 或 Uncaught TypeError: this.myMethod is not a function 之类的错误"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0puohvxu9k0","created":1582085997997,"text":"生命周期图示\nLifecycle Diagram"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c0pzahr1q5c0","created":1582099006153,"text":"红色的是钩子函数 ，mount，create","image":"https://cn.vuejs.org/images/lifecycle.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":78,"height":200}},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyr1mf9o00","created":1578035083859,"text":"Template Syntax模板语法","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fnhj386200","created":1592018580050,"text":"简介"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fnho67nvk0","created":1592018591114,"text":"Vue.js使用了基于HTML的模版愈发，允许开发者声明式地将DOM绑定至底层Vue实例的数据\n所有Vue.js模版本质上都是HTML，可以被解析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnid73ok80","created":1592018645587,"text":"底层实现上，Vue将模版编译成虚拟DOM渲染函数（Virtual DOM render functions）\n结合响应系统(reactivity system)，Vue会计算最少需要渲染的组件，并将DOM操作次数减到最少"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnr68z6000","created":1592019335741,"text":"也可以不用模板，直接写渲染 (render) 函数，使用可选的 JSX 语法。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0q2ejq50yo0","created":1582107787238,"text":"模版Template Syntax"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fnrio34c80","created":1592019362776,"text":"文本text"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fo0czc8io0","created":1592020055673,"text":"使用“Mustache”语法 (双大括号) 的文本插值\n<span>Message: {{ msg }}</span>\nmustache 标签会替代为对应数据对象上 msg property的值\n只要绑定的数据对象上property发生了变化，插值处就会更新"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fo1bw9rp40","created":1592020131675,"text":"v-once指令可执行一次性插值（interpolations）\n数据改变时，插值处的内容不会更新；但这会影响到该节点上的其他数据绑定\n<span v-once>这个将不会改变: {{ msg }}</span>"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnrrzya8w0","created":1592019383084,"text":"raw html"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fo4b9373c0","created":1592020365366,"text":"mustache 双大括号会将数据解释成普通文本而非HTML代码\n要输出真正的HTML，要使用v-html指令\n<p>Using mustaches: {{ rawHtml }}</p>\n<p>Using v-html directive: <span v-html=\"rawHtml\"></span></p>"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fo7r65cqo0","created":1592020635109,"text":" rawHtml的property 值会替换这个 span 的内容，直接作为 HTML，同时忽略解析 property 值中的数据绑定。\n注意，你不能使用 v-html 来复合局部模板，因为 Vue 不是基于字符串的模板引擎。\n对于用户界面 (UI)，组件（components）更适合作为可重用和可组合的基本单位。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fob251p2o0","created":1592020894079,"text":"谨慎使用v-html插值，容易导致xss攻击"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnrvdnsvk0","created":1592019390444,"text":"attributes"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3foblteeww0","created":1592020936911,"text":"mustache语法不能作用在HTML attribute上，需使用v-bind指令\n<div v-bind:id=\"dynamicId\"></div>"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fono7ydmw0","created":1592021882514,"text":"对于布尔 attribute (它们只要存在就意味着值为 true)，v-bind 工作起来略有不同，在这个例子中：\n<button v-bind:disabled=\"isButtonDisabled\">Button</button>\n如果 isButtonDisabled 的值是 null、undefined 或 false，则渲染出来的 <button> 元素中不会包含 disabled attribute。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnrz7lihs0","created":1592019398784,"text":"using javascript expressions","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3foqbv1ua80","created":1592022090705,"text":"表达式会在所属 Vue 实例的数据作用域下作为 JavaScript 被解析。\n每个绑定都只能包含单个表达式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3foqiiif4w0","created":1592022105184,"text":"{{ number + 1 }}\n\n{{ ok ? 'YES' : 'NO' }}\n\n{{ message.split('').reverse().join('') }}\n\n<div v-bind:id=\"'list-' + id\"></div>"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3foqzr9tio0","created":1592022142719,"text":"模版表达式都在sandbox中，只能访问全局变量的白名单(a whitelist of globals such as Math and Date)\n模版表达式中不能定义全局变量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0q2eucxxpc0","created":1582107810384,"text":"指令Directives"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3kzno9iqg00","created":1592560714601,"text":"指令Directives是带有 v- 前缀的特殊attribute，"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fns99r0gg0","created":1592019420682,"text":"arguments","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8dpvx9jtfc0","created":1610103022512,"text":"一些指令能够接收一个参数，指令名称之后以冒号表示，例如，v-bind 指令"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnsbcgby00","created":1592019425199,"text":"<a v-bind:href=\"url\">\n这里的href就是参数，v-bind 指令将该元素的href attribute与表达式 url的值绑定"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8dpwg1lqe00","created":1610103063390,"text":"<a v-on:click=\"doSomething\">\n用于监听DOM 事件，这里的参数是监听的事件名"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnse3m4rk0","created":1592019431195,"text":"dynamic arguments"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8dpy5nc87c0","created":1610103197488,"text":"用方括号括起来的 JavaScript 表达式作为一个指令的参数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnsk8s5og0","created":1592019444568,"text":"modifiers 修饰符"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8dpz76rwcw0","created":1610103279204,"text":"修饰符 (modifier) 是以半角句号 . 指明的特殊后缀，用于指出一个指令应该以特殊方式绑定"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"c0q2f2cb9eo0","created":1582107827761,"text":"缩写Shorthands","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c3fnv7fhymo0","created":1592019651769,"text":"v-bind"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8dq0los2n40","created":1610103389132,"text":"<!-- 完整语法 --><a v-bind:href=\"url\">...</a>\n\n<!-- 缩写 --><a :href=\"url\">...</a>\n\n<!-- 动态参数的缩写 (2.6.0+) --><a :[key]=\"url\"> ... </a>"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c3fnv9e8c600","created":1592019656045,"text":"v-on"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8dq0x67rfs0","created":1610103414131,"text":"<!-- 完整语法 --><a v-on:click=\"doSomething\">...</a>\n\n<!-- 缩写 --><a @click=\"doSomething\">...</a>\n\n<!-- 动态参数的缩写 (2.6.0+) --><a @[event]=\"doSomething\"> ... </a>"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"c6v18bdhucg0","created":1604549228188,"text":"计算属性和侦听器\ncomputed properties and watchers","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8itj96bvv40","created":1610621113927,"text":"模版内不应该写过于复杂的逻辑，应该放在计算属性中"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8itjv1e8340","created":1610621161518,"text":"计算属性卸载computed中，相当于getter函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8itkgd3bso0","created":1610621207938,"text":"计算属性和方法：作用上是一样的，\n计算属性响应式进行缓存(computed properties are cached based on their reactive dependencies)\n方法：method invocation will always run the function whenever a re-render happens.\n\ncomputed properties cashing while method not"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8itpdcss680","created":1610621593211,"text":"computed vs watched property\nvue 提供的computed 可以视作是对watch 的改进"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8ittaj3guo0","created":1610621900518,"text":"computed setter\nComputed properties are by default getter-only, but you can also provide a setter when you need it\n默认只有getter，需要setter的时候需要显式的写"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c8itv5cs6000","created":1610622045980,"text":"watch\nwatch 可以监控方法中某个变量的中间态（intermediary）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c6v18roiea00","created":1604549263682,"text":"class 和 style 绑定"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c8tmymmjqio0","created":1611719730423,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c6v18y3t4so0","created":1604549277668,"text":"条件渲染"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v190atrog0","created":1604549282446,"text":"列表渲染"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19cnx3y00","created":1604549309359,"text":"事件处理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19g0sgeg0","created":1604549316668,"text":"表单输入绑定"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19kuveiw0","created":1604549327194,"text":"组件基础"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyrgi5mq00","created":1578035116252,"text":"深入了解组件Components"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v19tejs6g0","created":1604549345798,"text":"组件注册"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19vjbd480","created":1604549350439,"text":"Prop"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19x630a00","created":1604549353993,"text":"自定义事件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v19z9rd6w0","created":1604549358569,"text":"插槽"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1a0pn8480","created":1604549361706,"text":"动态组件 & 异步组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1a4ods0w0","created":1604549370337,"text":"处理边界情况"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyrktsbeg0","created":1578035125663,"text":"过渡&动画\nTransitions & Animation"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v1acfi7y80","created":1604549387214,"text":"进入/离开 & 列表过渡"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1ahazlhc0","created":1604549397825,"text":"状态过渡"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyro6r9ts0","created":1578035132977,"text":"可复用性&组合\nReusability & Composition"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v1ancfo0g0","created":1604549410973,"text":"混入"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1apxavew0","created":1604549416589,"text":"自定义指令"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1as4d5b40","created":1604549421369,"text":"渲染函数 & JSX"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1awg0ay80","created":1604549430780,"text":"插件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1b77lecg0","created":1604549454216,"text":"过滤器"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyrw5iio00","created":1578035150316,"text":"工具\nTooling"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v1berrqv40","created":1604549470674,"text":"单文件组件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1bhrys5k0","created":1604549477216,"text":"测试"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1biy9v7s0","created":1604549479774,"text":"TypeScript"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1bm64y680","created":1604549486780,"text":"生产环境部署"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyrxr56v40","created":1578035153801,"text":"规模化\nScaling up"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v1bxevwv40","created":1604549511253,"text":"路由"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1bylae5c0","created":1604549513817,"text":"状态管理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1c0a8iu80","created":1604549517503,"text":"服务端渲染"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c6v1c3cro4w0","created":1604549524186,"text":"安全"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bzlyszrtxhc0","created":1578035236560,"text":"内在\nInternals"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c6v1bsarwj40","created":1604549500121,"text":"响应式原理"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}